  "title": "The Feeling In Photos: Thekla – 12th March 2016",
  "content": "<p><strong>The Fix&#8217;s Carly Dutton went along to catch <em>The Feeling</em>&#8216;s latest trip to Bristol at Thekla on Saturday 12th March. The band were in fine voice on this leg of their UK tour in line with the release of their self titled 5th studio album. Here&#8217;s some of her snaps and you can find more over on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.598523333639734.1073741838.151746464984092&amp;type=3\">Facebook page.</p>\n<p></a>For more on The Feeling, head to <a href=\"http://www.thefeeling.co.uk\">thefeeling.co.uk</a></strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_3210-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3210\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-11320 size-large\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_3210-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_3210-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_3210-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_3210-120x80.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_24722-666x450.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2472(2)\" width=\"666\" height=\"450\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-11321\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_24722-666x450.jpg 666w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_24722-300x203.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_24722-768x519.jpg 768w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_24722-120x80.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 666px) 100vw, 666px\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/IMG_2259-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2259\" width=\"675\"